quran[11]{c,v,t}:
  7,196,"Indeed, my Protector is Allah, Who sent down the Book, and He takes care of the righteous."
  7,197,Those (idols) you worship besides Him can neither help you nor can they help themselves.’
  7,198,"(O idolaters!) If you call upon them for guidance, they will not hear (you). You see them looking at you, but they do not see."
  7,199,"Take (the course of) pardoning, enjoin the good and pay no heed to the ignorant."
  7,200,"And if a temptation from Satan provokes you, seek refuge with Allah. Indeed, He is All-Hearing, All-Knowing."
  7,201,"Those who are God-conscious, when a visitation from Satan touches them, they remember (Allah), and behold, they perceive (through the eye of their heart)."
  7,202,"But as for their (fellow) brothers (i.e. the followers of Satan), those (devils) draw them further into error and then do not spare (them any harm)."
  7,203,"When you do not bring them a (fresh) revelation, they say: ‘Why do you not choose (to forge) it?’ Say: ‘I only follow what is revealed to me from my Lord. These are insights from your Lord, and a guidance and a mercy for a people who believe.’"
  7,204,"And (O believers!) when the Qur’an is recited, listen to it and remain silent. Perhaps you may be bestowed mercy."
  7,205,"And remember your Lord within your heart humbly and fearfully, without being loud of voice, in the morning and the evening. And do not be among the negligent."
  7,206,"Indeed, those who are (stationed) in the presence of your Lord are not arrogant to worship Him. They keep glorifying Him and prostrating to Him."
